  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Multiple vulnerabilities in glib2\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-58014.patch: Fix one-byte heap under-read in\n       g_key_file_get_locale_string_list() when value is empty.\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-58015.patch: Validate cookie_context in\n       GDBusAuthMechanismSha1 to prevent path traversal via DBUS_COOKIE_SHA1.\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-58016.patch: Fix XML parser state confusion in\n       gdbusintrospection when checking <node> element nesting.\n     - CVE-2026-58014\n     - CVE-2026-58015\n     - CVE-2026-58016",
